Value Filldown DESTINATIONS (\d+)
Value Filldown ROUTES (\d+)
Value Filldown DESTINATION (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+/\d+)
Value Filldown PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value Filldown PREFERENCE (\d+)
Value Filldown COST (\d+)
Value Required NEXTHOP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Destinations\s*:\s*${DESTINATIONS}\s+Routes\s*:\s*${ROUTES}
  ^\s*Destination/Mask\s+Proto\s+Pre\s+Cost\s+NextHop\s+Interface -> Routes
  ^.*

Routes
  ^\s*${DESTINATION}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${PREFERENCE}\s+${COST}\s+${NEXTHOP}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${NEXTHOP}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
